PROBLEM="Model an Email as a DDD value object that is always valid and compares by value."
LEARNINGS="DDD VALUE OBJECT: immutable, self-validating in the constructor (enforce invariants so an invalid instance can never exist), and compared by VALUE (use a record). Normalize on construction (trim + lowercase) so equal values are truly equal. No identity - two Emails with the same normalized value are the same."
ERRORS="Do NOT allow construction of an invalid value object (validate in the ctor and throw). Do NOT give a value object an Id/identity or mutable state - that makes it an Entity, not a Value Object."
TAGS="src:context7 lang:csharp area:architecture arch:ddd"
REF_SRC="Email.cs"
